{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nourish</strong> is a retro-styled 3D horror game about survival, responsibility, and the terrifying cost of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a junior employee of Echium Enterprises, you're tasked with transporting <i>Project V\u00e1yu</i> \u2014 a mysterious plant discovered on a distant alien world. Early research suggests it could solve Echium\u2019s oxygen shortage aboard deep-space vessels. But in isolation, far from home, you quickly realize the plant is growing... <i>hungry</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your time and dwindling resources carefully. Feed the plant. Maintain the ship. Survive.<br>Because if V\u00e1yu dies \u2014 you do too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you would like to support nourish during it's development, check out our Patreon: @Anarkorp</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703030/extras/Nyeef_SleepSmall.gif?t=1747803858\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703030?t=1747803858","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703030?t=1747803858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703030/62969e3fcdf0de059845cc024e0dafe6b272ad0b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747803858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703030/62969e3fcdf0de059845cc024e0dafe6b272ad0b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747803858","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids